<title>UK: Amersham surges on Nycomed merger plan.</title>
<headline>Amersham surges on Nycomed merger plan.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amersham International Plc shares surged in pre-market trade on Tuesday after the group said it planned to merge with Norway's Nycomed ASA, creating a global group capitalised at some 1.8 billion stg.</p>
<p>Amersham shares were quoted 205p higher at 18.00 stg by 0706 GMT.</p>
</text>
